@title Hoist run heat: current, winding rise and the overload relay buttons are shown
@area Simulate
# Opens the two-speed hoist fixture and starts Simulate > Hoist run: the heat line and its buttons.
open qa/fixtures/hoist-two-speed.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text Simulate hoist run
wait 4
key Enter
wait 20
click_text "Switch on Live"
wait 20
click_text "Start"
wait 40
shot heat-line
expect "Winding +"
expect "Let motors cool down"
expect_disabled "Reset overload relay"
expect "0.0 A"
check_layout
